  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chun Yuqiao quietly instructs his Studio Four supervisor to hold the studio line, while back in administration Bu Xiaogu discovers there is not a single chore left to do and pleads to help Unit One. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "四号棚情况怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "老大，一切正常。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "咱们真的要跟他们交接吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不交接，三部四部的人都归一部管。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "有什么活要干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您不是说这儿活多得都离不了人吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "员工手册已经发完了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "会客厅的地毯都洗过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一楼的碎玻璃和电梯按钮都已经修过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您愿意让我休息，也不让我去帮淳于总？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他那边真的特别忙，特别累。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "四号棚情况怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How is the situation over in Studio Four?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "老大，一切正常。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, everything is normal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "咱们真的要跟他们交接吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are we really going to hand things over to them?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不交接，三部四部的人都归一部管。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No handover; the staff from Units Three and Four stay under Unit One.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "有什么活要干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is there any work that needs doing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您不是说这儿活多得都离不了人吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not say there was so much work here that you could not spare anyone?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "员工手册已经发完了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The employee handbooks have already been handed out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "会客厅的地毯都洗过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The reception-room carpet has already been washed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一楼的碎玻璃和电梯按钮都已经修过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The broken glass on the first floor and the lift buttons have all been fixed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您愿意让我休息，也不让我去帮淳于总？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You would rather give me time off than let me go help Mr Chun Yuqiao?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他那边真的特别忙，特别累。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'His side is truly swamped and exhausted.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
